(19227,2,1,'Amazing amulets! Incredible curios! The newfangled jewelcrafters be havin\' nothin\' on the tried and true mystical methods of ol\' Griftah! Improve yerself through these magical talismans for a bargain price!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Griftah'),
